close_march.py is a byte-for-byte copy of results/WAVE2/F2/close_march.py (no changes).
sha256 (source and copy): 2e0975aa98c7dbcc2cf535993b54f57db764f7bf50f64fc54b9ff2860e67c855

Checks:
(a) fresh directory per job: march() uses tempfile.mkdtemp(prefix="m_<tag>_", dir=WORK) and solve()
    uses tempfile.mkdtemp(prefix="s_<k>_", dir=WORK); each CaDiCaL run and its cake_lpr check use only
    the files in that directory, which is removed after the record is built. OK.
(b) leaves.icnf and open.icnf are written by finalize().atomic(): tempfile.mkstemp in the output
    directory, then os.replace into place. OK.
(c) a new leaves.jsonl starts with {"case": --name, "case_sha256": sha256 of the case CNF}. OK.
Also: a leaf goes into leaves.icnf only if status == "UNSAT" and cake_lpr == "s VERIFIED UNSAT"
(AUDIT BUG-1); any other cake_lpr verdict is recorded as UNSAT_UNCHECKED and the cube stays open.
RISK-1 is avoided by (b); RISK-3(b) by (a); RISK-3(c) by running on a fresh output directory.
